00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:16,000
Meet the Devil. She's giving Elliott seven wishes. But not a chance in Hell.

2
00:10:20,000 --> 00:10:26,000
Bedazzled is a fantasy, comedy, romance film directed by Harold Ramis.

3
00:15:30,000 --> 00:15:36,000
Elliot Richards, a socially awkward IT worker, is given seven wishes to get
the girl of his dreams when he meets a very seductive Satan.

4
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:46,000
The catch: his soul.

5
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:56,000
Some of his wishes include being a 7 foot basketball star, a
wealthy, powerful man, and a sensitive caring guy.

6
00:31:00,000 --> 00:31:06,000
But, as could be expected, the Devil puts her own
little twist on each of his fantasies.

7
00:36:10,000 --> 00:36:16,000
Elliot, played by Brendan Fraser.

8
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:26,000
The Devil, played by Elizabeth Hurley.

9
00:46:30,000 --> 00:46:36,000
Alison / Nicole, played by Frances O'Connor.

10
00:51:40,000 --> 00:51:46,000
Carol / Penthouse Hostess, played by Miriam Shor.

11
00:56:50,000 --> 00:56:56,000
Dan / Esteban / Beach Jock / Sportscaster / African
Party Guest, played by Orlando Jones.

12
01:02:00,000 --> 01:02:06,000
Bob / Roberto / Beach Jock / Sportscaster /
Lincoln Aide, played by Paul Adelstein.

13
01:07:10,000 --> 01:07:16,000
Bedazzled is a 2000 fantasy romantic comedy film directed by Harold
Ramis and starring Brendan Fraser and Elizabeth Hurley.

14
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:26,000
It is a remake of the 1967 British film of the same name, written by Peter Cook
and Dudley Moore, itself a comic retelling of the Faust legend.

15
01:17:30,000 --> 01:17:36,000
It follows a computer company worker who makes a deal with the Devil to receive seven wishes in exchange for his soul
so he can pursue the woman he loves, though the Devil twists the spirit of each wish to frustrate him.

16
01:22:40,000 --> 01:22:46,000
The film explores themes of love of one's life, wish,
sale of soul, pact with the devil, remake.

17
01:27:50,000 --> 01:27:56,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional and mind_bending.
